---
workspace_name: "ZWave_SoC_SensorPIR_Solution"
label: "ZWave_SoC_SensorPIR_Solution"
quality: "production"
description: "Demonstrates passive infrared (PIR) sensor application combined with\
  \ OTA bootloader.  The Z-Wave certified passive infrared (PIR) sensor application\
  \ shows  a presence/movement detector implementation for controlling other devices\
  \  and for sending notifications.\n"
project:
- id: "application"
  path: "zwave_soc_sensor_pir.slcp"
  output: "."
- id: "bootloader"
  path: "..\\bootloader-storage-internal-single-zwave-ota_3\\bootloader-storage-internal-single-zwave-ota_3.slcp"
  output: "../bootloader-storage-internal-single-zwave-ota_3"
post_build:
  profile: "zwave_workspace"
  path: "ZWave_SoC_SensorPIR_Solution.slpb"
